      "note": "Anthropic first-party API list prices (Model pricing table). cache_write is the 5-minute cache write (1.25x input); a turn that wrote the 1-hour cache (2x) is under-priced, because which cache a claude turn wrote sits in a usage field om-agi has not measured. A subscription login is not billed at these prices; its owner sets their own in the price file."
    },
    {
      "backends": ["grok"],
      "url": "https://docs.x.ai/docs/models",
      "read": "2026-09-28",
      "note": "xAI API list prices, the tier for a prompt under 200k tokens. xAI bills a request whose prompt reaches 200k tokens at the higher tier for all of its tokens; a CLI turn's usage is summed over several requests, so which tier applied cannot be told from it, and the lower tier can only under-charge. xAI lists no cache-write price, so cache_write is null and a turn that wrote to the cache is not charged."
    }
  ],
